---
// Pricing.astro
---
<section id="pricing" class="py-24 bg-plai-black relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="text-center mb-16" data-animate>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-4">Planes</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 font-body max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Soluciones adaptadas a la etapa de tu negocio.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto" data-animate data-animate-stagger>
            <!-- AMP -->
            <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-2xl border border-plai-cyan/15 hover:border-plai-cyan/30 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col">
                <div class="text-plai-primary font-heading font-black text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">AMP</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-4">Asesoría en Medios de Pago</h3>
                <div class="text-2xl font-heading font-black text-plai-accent mb-2">Diagnóstico sin costo</div>
                <p class="text-gray-300 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed mt-auto">
                    Proyectos a la medida, costo a estimar según volumen y proveedores actuales.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- GEMA -->
            <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-2xl border border-plai-cyan/15 hover:border-plai-cyan/30 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col">
                <div class="text-plai-magenta font-heading font-black text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">GEMA</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-4">Marketing Automatizado</h3>
                <div class="text-2xl font-heading font-black text-white mb-2">$140.000 <span class="text-base font-normal text-gray-400">CLP/mes</span></div>
                <p class="text-gray-300 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed mt-auto">
                    Plan anual de marketing con estrategia, pilares de contenido y calendario comunicacional automatizado.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- ERI -->
            <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-2xl border border-plai-cyan/15 hover:border-plai-cyan/30 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col">
                <div class="text-plai-magenta font-heading font-black text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">ERI</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-4">Ejecutivo Resolutor Inteligente</h3>
                <div class="text-2xl font-heading font-black text-white mb-2">$200.000 <span class="text-base font-normal text-gray-400">CLP/mes</span></div>
                <p class="text-gray-300 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed mt-auto">
                    + $20.000 CLP única vez por # de WhatsApp empresa.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Plan PLAI (featured) -->
            <div class="bg-plai-primary p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-plai-secondary shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,100,255,0.3)] transition-all flex flex-col relative">
                <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-plai-cyan text-plai-black text-xs font-bold font-body px-4 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wide">Recomendado</div>
                <div class="text-white/80 font-heading font-black text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Plan PLAI</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-4">GEMA + ERI</h3>
                <div class="text-2xl font-heading font-black text-white mb-2">$280.000 <span class="text-base font-normal text-white/70">CLP/mes</span></div>
                <p class="text-white/80 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed mt-auto">
                    Marketing automatizado + agente inteligente de ventas. La solución completa para escalar tu negocio.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
